  "name": "Question 2",
  "problem": "Given $a=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]$, find $‖a‖.$",
  "worked_solution": "Using the formula for the norm, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖a‖ & =\\sqrt{{a}_{1}^{2}+{a}_{2}^{2}+{a}_{3}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{3}^{2}+{0}^{2}+{4}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9+16} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{25} \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
